# The build context is build/. The Containerfile adds two tarballs from
# cache/, and the rest of cache/ is large. The checkouts in it also hold
# symbolic links, which the container tool will not pack: it stops with
# "archive/tar: invalid tar header".
#
# Note that a rebuild of the image fails even with this file. The container
# tool carries the 829 MB tarball and then stops, and the 1.1 GB one never
# arrives, so the ADD of it cannot find it. That is why the build
# requirements of packages/ are installed in build.sh and not in the image.
cache/swift-6.4.0-macos
cache/swift-sdks
cache/venusbuild
cache/virglrenderer
cache/swift-6.4.0-RELEASE-osx.pkg
